{"timestamp": "2023-05-27T13:19:00+00:00", "time_ago": "3d ago", "role": "user", "relevance": {"rrf_score": 0.125, "fts_rank": 8}, "content": "Now that I think about it, I've been watching a lot of movies with complex villains lately, like the Joker in The Dark Knight. It's interesting to see how different actors bring these characters to life. Anyway, back to Shazam!, I'm curious about the movie's themes. Can you tell me more about what the film is trying to say about family and identity?"}
{"timestamp": "2023-05-27T08:02:00+00:00", "time_ago": "3d ago", "role": "user", "content": "Do you think the influence of postmodernism on music has been positive or negative?"}
